DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261207T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261207T153000
SUMMARY:Book Faire & Reading Week (through Dec 10)
DESCRIPTION:The annual Scholastic Book Faire is back: books at school all week, and every purchase benefits the school. Open late Dec 10 during the Winter Festival; breakdown Dec 11, 11am-1pm.
LOCATION:Falls Building
END:VEVENT
